cff-version: 1.2.0
message: "If you use fmri-qa in published work, please cite this software."
title: "fmri-qa"
type: software
abstract: >-
  Phantom fMRI quality assurance, distributed as five packages: fmri-qa-core
  (metrics and the analysis file; pure calculation), fmri-qa-io (scan and
  analysis files, DICOM import), fmri-qa-cli (the fmri-qa commands),
  fmri-qa-report (plots and a self-contained HTML report), and fmri-qa-launcher
  (a one-step DICOM-in, report-out application shell).
authors:
  - family-names: "Storrs"
    given-names: "Judd"
version: 0.1.0
license: MIT
